{"id":67675,"title":"125 |【实验】Prometheus起步查询实验（中）","content":"本次内容完成普罗米修斯起步实验的后半部分，核心在于搭建服务器并利用 PromQL 执行监控查询。首先部署普罗米修斯服务，通过修改 prometheus.yml 配置文件，将全局抓取与评估间隔调整为 5 秒，并新增作业以抓取运行在 8080 端口的 HTTP 模拟器指标。启动服务后，访问本地 9090 端口 Web UI，确认普罗米修斯自身与模拟器两个目标均处于\"up\"正常状态。\n\n随后深入实践 PromQL 查询语法：利用基础指标 up 配合标签过滤器（如 job=\"http_simulator\"）精准定位特定作业状态；针对计数器类型指标 http_requests_total，结合 status 和 endpoint 等多维标签筛选特定场景数据，例如查询登录接口的成功请求数。进一步运用聚合函数提升分析维度，使用 sum 对按端点区分的成功请求进行总和计算，利用 rate 函数配合时间窗口（如 [5m]）计算瞬时请求速率，并将 sum 与 rate 嵌套使用以获取整体系统的成功请求率。该流程完整展示了从环境配置、状态验证到多维度指标查询与分析的技术闭环。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":155383,"user_name":"阿卜杜拉阿拉巴马赫雷斯哈姆西克","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1224060,"ip_address":"","ucode":"281E99D46C4876","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/ad/7c/48b53fa4.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1574684106,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":60063,"content":"你好，rate就是求的每秒成功请求的平均值(区分不同端点)，sum是聚合计算总的每秒成功的平均值(不区分端点)。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1574861055,"ip_address":"","comment_id":155383,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"杨老师，请问最后的请求成功率为什么求的总数而不是平均数。","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":475736,"discussion_content":"你好，rate就是求的每秒成功请求的平均值(区分不同端点)，sum是聚合计算总的每秒成功的平均值(不区分端点)。","content_length":56,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1574861055,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":265546,"user_name":"正是那朵玫瑰","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1048261,"ip_address":"","ucode":"73D630B654573F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/fe/c5/3467cf94.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1606926144,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":96706,"content":"用increase函数，参考这个：\nhttps:&#47;&#47;stackoverflow.com&#47;questions&#47;47138461&#47;get-total-requests-in-a-period-of-time\n","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"杨波","uid":1030344,"ctime":1607268287,"ip_address":"","comment_id":265546,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100007001,"comment_content":"波波老师，如果求过去三十分钟内服务的总请求量该怎么求呢？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1030344,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/b8/c8/c94d38a7.jpg","nickname":"杨波","note":"","ucode":"FA3418BB703BCA","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":510971,"discussion_content":"用increase函数，参考这个：\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/47138461/get-total-requests-in-a-period-of-time\n","content_length":102,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1607268287,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}